    "title": "DOS Style Watch face",
    "description": "For PC enthusiasts who grew up with command line operating systems, this Wear OS clock face shows the time in DOS style. It supports the 12/24h view. The color can be changed to white, green and orange/red to match the monitor types used at the time. In ambience mode, only the time and date are displayed.",
    "descriptionHTML": "For PC enthusiasts who grew up with command line operating systems, this Wear OS clock face shows the time in DOS style. It supports the 12/24h view. The color can be changed to white, green and orange/red to match the monitor types used at the time. In ambience mode, only the time and date are displayed.",
